    <string name="health_rationale_title">Why FlipsiBridge reads health data</string>
    <string name="health_rationale_intro">FlipsiBridge is the bridge for my voice assistant — the agent with its own server. From Health Connect it may — ONLY with my consent here in Health Connect — READ these values: steps, distance, calories burned, heart rate, sleep and weight.</string>
    <string name="health_rationale_usage">The data feeds the daily overview (e.g. report pulse, steps over the day, sleep window). Nothing is WRITTEN to Health Connect, nothing is deleted without permission, no data sharing with third parties — the server runs in the home network.</string>
    <string name="health_rationale_change">Change anytime: Health Connect → Data and access → FlipsiBridge → toggle each permission on/off.</string>
    <string name="health_rationale_ok">Got it</string>
